OL,3,ABorrowing costs rise again as Burnham
OL,4,Aprepares for first PMQs
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe cost of borrowing money for the UK
OL,7,Fhas nudged higher, reaching an 18-year
OL,8,Fhigh, as Andy Burnham prepares to face
OL,9,Fhis first PMQs
OL,11,FIt has risen sharply for the UK, and
OL,12,Fgovernments around the world, in recent
OL,13,Fweeks - and is up again slightly this
OL,14,Fmorning
OL,16,FLord O'Neill, who advised Burnham as he
OL,17,Fentered Downing Street, says those
OL,18,Fcosts will force Labour to "get real"
OL,19,Fabout "dealing with the [state pension]
OL,20,Ftriple lock" and "excessive" welfare
OL,21,Fspending
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/41
