OL,3,ABorrowing costs rise again as Burnham
OL,4,Aprepares for first PMQs
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Tuesday, Burnham faced MPs for the
OL,7,Ffirst time since becoming PM in July,
OL,8,Fin a session lasting over three hours
OL,10,FHe pledged "stronger public control" of
OL,11,Fessential services - Conservative
OL,12,Fleader Kemi Badenoch said his ideas
OL,13,Fwere just "more government control,
OL,14,Fmore spending, more tax"
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/41
